#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/estadistica/snippets/helplers.html:4
msgid "¿What is the Statistics and Search Dashboard?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/estadistica/snippets/helplers.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <p>The Statistics and Search Dashboard is an advanced platform tool "
"enables the visualization,\n"
"        analysis, and location of information assets managed in CKAN through "
"a modern Angular interface.</p>\n"
"\n"
"      <p>This component centralizes key indicators and metadata, ensuring "
"that data is discoverable,\n"
"          accessible, and actionable in real time. By integrating dynamic "
"search capabilities and \n"
"          visual analytics, it ensures that technical information is useful "
"for decision-making, \n"
"          complies with interoperability standards, and promotes "
"institutional transparency through\n"
"          an optimized and secure user experience.</p>\n"
"\n"
"      <p>Puntos clave de esta referencia:</p>\n"
"          <p><strong>Technology:</strong> The architecture (Angular on CKAN) "
"is explicitly mentioned to\n"
"          provide technical context.</p>\n"
"\n"
"          <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Focused on \"visualization\" and "
"\"analysis,\" which is what the user\n"
"            sees on your dashboard.</p>\n"
"\n"
"          <p><strong>Data Quality:</strong> It upholds the promise of the "
"\"Seals of Excellence\" by \n"
"              mentioning standards of interoperability and transparency.</p>\n"
"\n"
"          <p><strong>Added Value:</strong> Highlights \"decision-making\" and"
" \"user experience,\" justifying\n"
"              why you are improving the design and interface.</p>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

