#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:4
msgid "¿What are the Seals of Excellence?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"        The Digital Government Excellence Seals are a recognition from the "
"Ministry of Information Technologies and Communications (MinTIC)\n"
"        for digital services and open datasets that meet high\n"
"        standards of quality, security, accessibility, and transparency. It "
"certifies that\n"
"        the State's digital products respond to citizens' needs,\n"
"        comply with regulations, promote trust and participation, and "
"guarantee\n"
"        continuous improvement. For open data, it ensures that it is useful, "
"up-to-date,\n"
"        and reusable.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""

